{"c":[{"name":"20261003T203647Z-db99791d758fef32","text":"swift test under heavy.sh peaks at 0.25-0.44 GB RSS (/usr/bin/time -l, B18); a 6 GiB lease estimate is refused below ~17 GiB free disk, so ask for 2 GiB.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261003T221243Z-01ce9c46dd16673e","text":"Routine evals must copy new values each occurrence: with static source text the closed earlier destination's recent text is credited as the next source, the shape changes and predictions miss (B19; caret-fixture --windows forms, stdin form next).","type":"note"}]}
